    "178422256487e7a2a3": {
      "type": "_blocks",
      "blocks": {
        "ai_gen_block_48118d9_akiNYE": {
          "type": "ai_gen_block_48118d9",
          "settings": {
            "section_title": "15,000+ wide face babes served",
            "section_subtitle": "Real reviews from real customers",
            "header_alignment": "center",
            "header_spacing": 40,
            "desktop_width_percent": 100,
            "section_padding": 30,
            "columns_desktop": 4,
            "columns_mobile": "2",
            "grid_gap": 10,
            "background_color": "#ffffff",
            "card_background": "#faf9f6",
            "card_padding": 20,
            "card_spacing": 15,
            "card_border_width": 1,
            "card_border_color": "#e6e6e6",
            "card_border_radius": 8,
            "show_ratings": true,
            "star_size": 16,
            "star_color": "#69451b",
            "avatar_size": 45,
            "author_spacing": 12,
            "avatar_placeholder_bg": "#dfd1c0",
            "avatar_placeholder_text": "#000000",
            "title_font": "newsreader_n2",
            "title_size": 48,
            "title_spacing": 15,
            "subtitle_size": 14,
            "body_font": "fahkwang_n4",
            "text_size": 12,
            "author_name_size": 14,
            "author_title_size": 12,
            "title_color": "#000000",
            "subtitle_color": "#666666",
            "text_color": "#000000",
            "author_name_color": "#000000",
            "author_title_color": "#666666",
            "testimonial_1_text": "\"I love love love every single detail of these Sol Kyst sunglasses! I have never been more grateful for a pair of sunnies that do not make me look wider than I actually am in pictures! I feel seen, heard, embraced, and confident in these beauties. A must-have staple!\"",
            "testimonial_1_author_name": "Ana D",
            "testimonial_1_author_title": "Verified Buyer",
            "testimonial_1_rating": 5,
            "testimonial_2_text": "\"The relief I had when I tried them on made me so happy I cried. Never have I ever tried a more perfect pair of glasses in my life. Thank you from the bottom of my heart.\"",
            "testimonial_2_author_name": "Jazmin Rico",
            "testimonial_2_author_title": "Verified Buyer",
            "testimonial_2_rating": 5,
            "testimonial_3_text": "\"When I tell you I haven’t been able to find a good pair of sunglasses since my D&G's and I am finally SO SO happy with my purchase! These sunnies are a confidence booster I didn’t know I needed. I had bought about 13 pairs of different sunglasses in the last 4 years trying to get a new pair that would flatter my chubby face and Sol Kyst are finally the ones I absolutely love. They are made with great material. They feel tough enough that you know they don’t break easily but it doesn’t look like cheap plastic. Super fashionable and the case it comes with is a perfect color and material. It will match with whatever purse you have that day! I had a question about my order (before receiving them) and I got a reply right away about my concerns. Overall, this brand is fantastic and she’s just getting started! I can’t wait to see what’s next ♥ Will definitely be buying again.\"",
            "testimonial_3_author_name": "Yeni Anguiano",
            "testimonial_3_author_title": "Verified Buyer",
            "testimonial_3_rating": 5,
            "testimonial_4_text": "\"I couldn’t recommend these more. I’ve never had a pair of sunglasses that have fit, let alone feminine ones. Even men's were snug and uncomfortable. I was checking tracking every 20 minutes the day they arrived and when I tried them on the first time I teared up. They fit and feel so much better than even expected and they look so cute. I was so excited and I haven’t taken them off since. They are so flattering and I will be ordering more in every colour. I’m in love. Shipping was also very quick! I received them across the country in less than a week. Quality is better than other designer/high-end glasses I have purchased. Seriously, order them. You won’t regret it.\"",
            "testimonial_4_author_name": "/ Jacey Loewen",
            "testimonial_4_author_title": "Verified Buyer",
            "testimonial_4_rating": 5,
            "testimonial_5_text": "\"Never before in my life have I put on a pair of sunglasses that I am 100% happy with. These sunnies are high quality, stylish, and so flattering I am honestly shocked. I had long ago surrendered to the idea that sunglasses just didn’t look good on me and I debated buying these for months before finally purchasing during a 'less than perfect' sale. Not only are they the perfect fit for my wide face but I truly can’t see what deemed them less than perfect in the first place. 10/10. LOVE THEM! Don’t sleep on these, they are everything they claim to be!!\"",
            "testimonial_5_author_name": "Lisa B",
            "testimonial_5_author_title": "Verified Buyer",
            "testimonial_5_rating": 5,
            "testimonial_6_text": "",
            "testimonial_6_author_name": "",
            "testimonial_6_author_title": "Verified Buyer",
            "testimonial_6_rating": 5,
            "testimonial_7_text": "\"By far these are the best glasses I’ve ever worn. I have pretty wide cheek bones and these don’t squeeze my head at all so I can wear them all day. I feel powerful and confident when I have them on because I finally have sunglasses that flatter me.\"",
            "testimonial_7_author_name": "Ashley Scott",
            "testimonial_7_author_title": "Verified Buyer",
            "testimonial_7_rating": 5,
            "testimonial_8_text": "\"When I was born, my mom's friends nicknamed me Head Quarters. Needless to say I have a large round face. I’ve struggled my entire life for sunglasses that not only fit my face but also flatter it. They don’t pinch my temples, and look chic.\"",
            "testimonial_8_author_name": "Laura Brown",
            "testimonial_8_author_title": "Verified Buyer",
            "testimonial_8_rating": 5,
            "testimonial_9_text": "\"I’ve been waiting my whole life for glasses that actually fit me well! These fit perfectly and are SO cute! So happy I found this brand.\"",
            "testimonial_9_author_name": "Sally Gietzen",
            "testimonial_9_author_title": "Verified Buyer",
            "testimonial_9_rating": 5,
            "testimonial_10_text": "\"I was a bit apprehensive of buying these glasses, but let me tell you... I absolutely love them. I've gotten so many compliments when I took them on vacation to Punta Cana! I've always had a hard time finding glasses that fit my face and since I've found this company I now have four pairs from the site!\"",
            "testimonial_10_author_name": "Joyce Gail",
            "testimonial_10_author_title": "Verified Buyer",
            "testimonial_10_rating": 5,
            "testimonial_11_text": "\"I found Sol Kyst on TikTok by chance (or so I thought) and decided to give a few of the sale aviators a try. I was hesitant at first, but they are everything I ever dreamed of and more! They are high quality and frame my face to perfection. It’s a dream to have large aviators that actually fit and flatter my face. Also, the company’s customer service is absolutely incredible and the owner is someone I am so proud to support. You can definitely buy with confidence and they’ll answer any product questions you have. I would highly recommend giving some of their styles a shot! I personally love Tyler & Charli but I’ll be purchasing others very soon! You won’t be disappointed.\"",
            "testimonial_11_author_name": "Becca",
            "testimonial_11_author_title": "Verified Buyer",
            "testimonial_11_rating": 5,
            "testimonial_12_text": "",
            "testimonial_12_author_name": "",
            "testimonial_12_author_title": "Verified Buyer",
            "testimonial_12_rating": 5,
            "testimonial_13_text": "\"I have had these since the very first orders went out when this brand started. It’s safe to say they’ve been put to the test. I’ve dropped them, sat on them, they’ve traveled with me, and been shoved to the bottom of my backpack many times. The quality and durability of these has yet to fail me. If you are wondering if you should pull the trigger to buy these THIS IS YOUR SIGN TO BUY IT ❤️ Also they cute as all get out!\"",
            "testimonial_13_author_name": "S.C",
            "testimonial_13_author_title": "Verified Buyer",
            "testimonial_13_rating": 5,
            "testimonial_14_text": "",
            "testimonial_14_author_name": "",
            "testimonial_14_author_title": "Verified Buyer",
            "testimonial_14_rating": 5,
            "testimonial_15_text": "\"As with much of the fashion industry only making clothing for one (small) body type, sunglasses have never been designed with different face shapes in mind and seem to only focus on slim faces. I found Sol Kyst through a TikTok where the owner was showing the difference between small and wide sunglasses. I bought these SO FAST!! Our worth as a human is NEVER tied to how clothing or sunglasses look on us because they are meant to serve US, not the other way around. But to finally have shades designed SPECIFICALLY for my face shape has helped me feel even more confident and I am just so obsessed with these!\"",
            "testimonial_15_author_name": "Tina Van Aarsen",
            "testimonial_15_author_title": "Verified Buyer",
            "testimonial_15_rating": 5,
            "testimonial_16_text": "\"Wow, so happy I found Sol Kyst! I’ve purchased Celine’s before in vain as even Celine’s weren’t quite as big as I need to compliment my wide face. I’ve received my first pair of glasses from Sol Kyst today and the quality of materials is exactly the same as I experienced with other overpriced designer brands except even better because they actually compliment me and don’t give me headaches from the tightness on my temples. I will absolutely be purchasing more from this site and can’t wait to see what new designs they come up with!\"",
            "testimonial_16_author_name": "Chica Villalobos",
            "testimonial_16_author_title": "Verified Buyer",
            "testimonial_16_rating": 5,
            "testimonial_17_text": "\"I’m obsessed with these sunglasses. I have a round face and I’ve never had a pair of sunglasses that I actually feel comfortable and confident wearing before. I have bought countless sunglasses my whole life trying to find the right pair. I’m so glad I bought these! They fit and flatter! First pair I truly think actually look good on me. So happy! And love the customer service! Highly recommend.\"",
            "testimonial_17_author_name": "Daniel Gentili",
            "testimonial_17_author_title": "Verified Buyer",
            "testimonial_17_rating": 5,
            "testimonial_18_text": "\"Thank you so much for (finally!!!) making chic women’s sunglasses in larger widths! I almost cried when I first put these on and realized I didn’t feel any discomfort. I’m so grateful. Also, they’re really high quality and the Obsidian style is cute af.\"",
            "testimonial_18_author_name": "Abigail Reno",
            "testimonial_18_author_title": "Verified Buyer",
            "testimonial_18_rating": 5,
            "testimonial_19_text": "",
            "testimonial_19_author_name": "",
            "testimonial_19_author_title": "Verified Buyer",
            "testimonial_19_rating": 5,
            "testimonial_20_text": "\"I have a big head and most sunglasses look awkward on me. I feel glamorous in these sunglasses. I feel included and beautiful!\"",
            "testimonial_20_author_name": "Emily Henry",
            "testimonial_20_author_title": "Verified Buyer",
            "testimonial_20_rating": 5
          },
          "blocks": {}
        }
      },
