          "name": "t:names.text",
          "settings": {
            "text": "<p>Sol Kyst - the viral Canadian wide fit sunglasses brand now designed in multiple frame sizes to fit and flatter more face shapes, specializing in wide fit eyewear for the wide face babes and proportions of round face cheeky girls.<br/><br/>Not sure what size you are? Start with your current sunglasses. If they pinch, leave marks, sit too high, don't reach your ears, or feel tight at the temples, you may need a wider fit! </p><p>Because 'one size fits all' never actually did.</p>",
